{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201230","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1820123001:0":{"text":"Long time no see, Sabrine!","source_cn":"莎柏琳，好久不见啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38656F8688679BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820123002:1":{"text":"What have you been up to lately? Honestly, you've got me scratching my head.","source_cn":"你最近都忙什么呢？真让我摸不着头脑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B2B31CC75D7B0AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820123003:0":{"text":"I've been racking my brain trying to figure you out! Hold on... why does my neck feel so cold all of a sudden?","source_cn":"然后我想啊想啊，想啊想啊——这时候，我突然发现，我的脖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDFFA7E3F225974C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820123004:0":{"text":"Hmm, let me see why...","source_cn":"往上一摸，我发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76454DA8A9D76BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820123005:1":{"text":"Ah, it's because... <style=\"highlight\">my head's gone</style>! No wonder I can't think straight! HAHAHA!","source_cn":"我的头真的掉了！这次，我是真的<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDA96EB78E2CBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820123006:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820123007:0":{"text":"Look at your face—pale as a sheet! Oh, come on, don't be such a scaredy-cat! See? My head's back on!","source_cn":"哈哈！吓到了吗？别这么胆小！我这不是把头安回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE65ECD26A68A2218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820123008:0":{"text":"Wait, I've got a good one too!","source_cn":"等等！我也有，我也有笑话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C192C5BCB793C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820123009:0":{"text":"One day, I realized a section of my shinbone had vanished. It made me a whole head shorter than Dayd!","source_cn":"有一天，我发现我的小腿骨突然少了一节。这可麻烦了，我比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D68C71628329BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820123010:0":{"text":"I had to show everyone the real reason I got shorter!","source_cn":"万一你们不相信我是因为这个才比死考夫矮的，以为我是在找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA3598354E8184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820123011:0":{"text":"Then, inspiration struck...","source_cn":"所以，我也想了个好办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AC83D5CEFD5440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820123012:0":{"text":"I turned myself into a skeleton, hahaha, but I failed to turn myself back!","source_cn":"——那就是把自己变成骷髅！啊哈哈哈！可惜，我变不回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590796C559FFF107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820123013:0":{"text":"Don't you feel sorry for me, young lady? How about lending me your skin and flesh?","source_cn":"你说，是不是很可惜？小姑娘，把你的皮肉借给我好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB3A8DCD7E04DE5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820123014:0":{"text":"<shk>E-Enough!!!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>你、你们——</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A01D6207491982E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820123015:0":{"text":"Cut it out, you two, or I'll make you wish you could die a second time.","source_cn":"好了，不要再胡闹了。除非你们打算再次和世界永别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27396AAADF55845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820123016:0":{"text":"Okay, okay... You're terrifying when you get serious, Sabrine!","source_cn":"好啦好啦……严肃起来的莎柏琳真可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A48BC83F8848CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1820123017:1":{"text":"They're just a bunch of idiots who find joy in scaring other people. You'll get used to it.","source_cn":"别紧张，他们总爱做这种事，靠吓唬人来找乐子，慢慢习惯就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D39C882839166B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1820123018:1":{"text":"If they ever go too far, just yank one of their limbs off, then give them a good beating.","source_cn":"如果他们真的太过分了——去把他们手里的肢体抢下来，狠狠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB9EA8B26199305B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1820123019:1":{"text":"Usually, the first step is enough to set them straight.","source_cn":"通常在第一步，他们就会学乖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA34C1FA304431251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:死考夫":{"text":"Dayd","source":"死考夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"Vivi","source":"薇薇娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:金姆":{"text":"Jeem","source":"金姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莎柏琳":{"text":"Sabrine","source":"莎柏琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":4}}